1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
'힘내'라는 말, 좀 지치지 않나요?
Aren't you tired of hearing "hang in there" lately?

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,457
헨리 나우웬은 말했어요.
Henri Nouwen wrote that the people who mean the most to us are

3
00:00:06,557 --> 00:00:13,429
소중한 건 조언이 아니라 아픔을 나눈 사람이라고.
"those who, instead of giving advice, solutions, or cures,
have chosen rather to share our pain and touch our wounds with a warm and tender hand."

4
00:00:13,529 --> 00:00:17,819
힘내 문자에 답장 못 하던 밤.
A night spent staring at a "hang in there" text, unable to reply.

5
00:00:17,919 --> 00:00:23,500
필요한 건 방법이 아니라 옆자리일지도요.
What you needed wasn't a method.
Maybe it was a seat beside you.

6
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:30,000
오늘은 아무 말 않고 옆에 있을게요.
Today, I won't say anything.
I'll just stay beside you.
